---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Services — Agentic AI Automation, Revenue Systems, SEO, Paid Ads & AI Automation | Muheeb Sulaiman"
  description="Agentic AI Automation, Digital marketing strategy, SEO and organic growth, paid ads and performance marketing, website and funnel systems, and AI automation workflows — built for measurable revenue, not reach."
>
  <div class="services-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="label">Services</div>
      <h1 class="display-lg" style="color:var(--paper); max-width:800px; margin-bottom:20px;">Not Services. Revenue Systems.</h1>
      <p>Everything I offer is designed to produce measurable, compounding revenue results — not reports, rankings, or reach.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="padding-bottom:120px;">
    <div class="services-detail-grid">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">🎯</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Brand Strategy & Positioning</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">A strategic foundation for your business: the positioning, audience clarity, messaging, and offer design that make every channel work harder.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Market and competitor analysis</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Audience segmentation and messaging</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Offer positioning and value proposition</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">90-day growth roadmap</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">🔍</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">AIO, AEO, GEO, SEO & Organic Growth</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">A compounding search engine system that builds high-intent traffic you own, reducing dependence on paid acquisition while increasing long-term discoverability.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Technical SEO audit and fixes</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Keyword and content strategy</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">On-page optimisation</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Authority and backlink growth and More</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">📊</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Paid Ads & Performance Marketing</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">Direct-response campaigns across Meta, Google, and other acquisition channels built to drive revenue, not just clicks, reach, or vanity metrics.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Meta ads and Instagram campaigns</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Google Search and Display</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Retargeting and audience testing</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">ROAS and profitability reporting</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">✍️</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Content Strategy & Copywriting</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">Sales-driven content systems designed to attract the right audience, build authority, and convert attention into enquiries, leads, and purchases.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Editorial and content planning</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Ad, landing page, and website copy</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Thought leadership and brand storytelling</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Content calendars and production systems</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">🌐</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Website Design & Conversion Funnels</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">High-converting digital experiences that turn traffic into leads and leads into clients through better design, faster flows, and clearer offers.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Landing page design and optimisation</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Lead magnet and opt-in funnels</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Sales page and checkout flows</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Booking and call funnel integration</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">📈</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Lead Generation & Sales Systems</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">Systems built to consistently create, qualify, and convert leads using the right channels, messaging, and follow-up paths for your business.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Outbound and inbound lead systems</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Lead qualification and scoring</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">CRM and pipeline structure</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Lead nurture sequences</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">💬</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Email, WhatsApp & CRM Automation</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">Automated communication systems that keep leads warm, reduce manual follow-up, and improve response time without sacrificing personalisation.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Email marketing setup and flows</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">WhatsApp nurture automation</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">CRM integration and data capture</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Lead routing and follow-up triggers</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">📱</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Social Media Growth Systems</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">A content engine built to turn brand visibility into pipeline — combining strategy, performance creative, and distribution across channels that move buyers.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Content pillars and posting strategy</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Audience growth and engagement systems</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Creative direction and campaign support</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Social proof and authority building</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card" style="grid-column:span 2;">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">⚡</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">AI Automation & Workflow Optimisation</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">AI-powered systems that remove repetitive work, shorten response time, and help your business scale without adding unnecessary overhead.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px 32px;">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">AI content and research workflows</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">CRM and pipeline automation</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Client onboarding and response flows</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Reporting and analytics automation</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Lead scoring and routing logic</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Marketing task and scheduling systems</div>
        </div>
         </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">📊</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Agentic AI Automation (n8n & Zapier)</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">Agentic AI Automation (n8n & Zapier).</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Zapier</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">n8n</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Monday CRM, Salesforce, Google Sheet</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Whatsapp Automation</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <div class="cta-section__bg"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <div class="label" style="justify-content:center;">Get Started</div>
        <h2 class="display-md" style="color:var(--paper); margin-bottom:16px;">Let's Discuss Your Growth Situation</h2>
        <p>I do a free 30-minute diagnostic call for serious enquiries. No pitch. Just a clear read on your situation and what would actually move the needle.</p>
        <div class="cta-section__btns">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact"><span>→ Book Diagnostic Call</span></a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/2349110172901?text=Hi%20Muheeb%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20your%20services." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg"><span>💬 WhatsApp First</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
